OL,3,GNEWSADance music festival could treble
OL,4,Ain size
OL,5,
OL,6,FA music festival at the former home of
OL,7,FWOMAD could almost treble in size to
OL,8,Falmost 15,000 people.
OL,10,FGemfest has applied for a new premises
OL,11,Flicence allowing it to hold an annual
OL,12,Ffour-day festival at Charlton Park
OL,13,FEstate, near Malmesbury, Wiltshire.
OL,15,FThe independent festival, aimed at fans
OL,16,Fof house, garage, jungle and drum &
OL,17,Fbass, was originally licensed for no
OL,18,Fmore than 5,000 people when it arrived
OL,19,Fat the estate in 2025.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
