OL,3,GNEWSADance music festival could treble
OL,4,Ain size
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut its new application would allow
OL,7,F12,500 people at the first festival
OL,8,Fheld under the licence, rising to
OL,9,F14,999 at the second and subsequent
OL,10,Fevents. The 450-acre Charlton Park
OL,11,FEstate had previously been home to the
OL,12,FWorld of Music, Arts and Dance for 17
OL,13,Fyears.
